{"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false}],"title":"MISOBulletList","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOBulletListV","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Item"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/TextStyle","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Type","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/UnorderedAsset"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Bullet list is a UI element that helps to view in related individual text items grouped together; items usually starting with a number or a bullet."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bullet list is also known as "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered list"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered list"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and is not an interactive element by default."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/ContentDisplay"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Types","text":"Types","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three types are proposed:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unordered (by default)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items that don’t need to be in a specific order or sequence."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items with numeric order or sequence."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bare"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": An unordered list without any bullets or alphanumeric sequence."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Types can be mixed in list, but must be identical for the same "},{"code":"MISOBulletList.NestedLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Levels","text":"Levels","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists can include nested items to indicate hierarchy or subcategories, with indentation distinguishing each level."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Arrange ordered list items logically, such as ranking by importance, highest to lowest values, or in alphabetical \/ numeric order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Three levels are maximum."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Text-Style","text":"Text Style","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List can be used with different font sizes:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Large"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Large text. This variant is designed for more visual, engaging experiences."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Medium text. This variant is best suited for functional, task-oriented experiences."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","text":"Cases forbidden by design","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it is not allowed to have a depth of items greater than 3"}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Internationalisation-considerations","text":"Internationalisation considerations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For latin-based speaking countries, like France, Spain, United Kingdom or Belgium, the european “arabic” numbers are used for the first level of depth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the ordered bullet list. For the second and third levels, the european alphabets are used with upper and lower case values."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"However for countries speaking arabic, these rules can’t be applied. Indeed, there is no notion of upper and lower case characters in arabic alphabet."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition, the numbers in use (i.e. the european “arabic” numbers like “1, 2, 3”) are accepted in arabic countries, even if the “true arabic” numbers (like “ ٢ ٣ ١”) are used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in middle-east arabic countries and for official documents."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus the MISO ordered bullet list will use “european” numbers for first level, and arabic alphabets for second and third levels."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["       \/\/ 1. Unordered list with bullets","       MISOBulletList {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 1.1. Item of Unordered list with bullet as tick, a text style","       \/\/ body medium and text bold","       MISOBulletList(type: .unordered(asset: .tick),","                      textStyle: .bodyMedium,","                      isBold: true)  {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 2. Bare list with 3 items","       MISOBulletList(type: .bare) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3. Ordered list with 3 items","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3.1. Ordered list with 3 items in first level,","       \/\/ and one item as sub item (second level),","       \/\/ and 2 items as sub item in (third level)","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\") {","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ Same Bullet list but items in third level with free icon as bullet","       let icon = Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\", subListType: .unordered(asset: .icon(icon))) {","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Rich-text-recommendations","text":"Rich text recommendations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be applied for bullet list whatever the "},{"code":"isBold","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly within alert messages to highlight key information."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be used for emphasis, as it is commonly associated with links."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined links must be bold."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a hyperlink is needed within the content, the underlined style should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Italic should be used with care, some brands do not allow it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.1.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"name":"Version"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 1.2.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist"]}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/TextStyle":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/textstyle","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TextStyle"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The typography style for the list item"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TextStyle"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/TextStyle","title":"MISOBulletList.TextStyle"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/Type":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/type","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Type"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The visual type of the list"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Type"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Type","title":"MISOBulletList.Type"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/ContentDisplay":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components can be used for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"content display"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/contentdisplay","type":"topic","role":"article","kind":"article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"title":"Content Display","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/ContentDisplay"},"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)":{"title":"init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a bullet list with a bullet type, text style and bold."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/init(type:textstyle:isbold:items:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"type"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"